<title>UK: Eurofima sets 500 billion lira August 2006 FRN.</title>
<headline>Eurofima sets 500 billion lira August 2006 FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by joint lead managers BNL, Credito Italiano and</p>
<p>San Paolo.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROFIMA</p>
<p> AMT    500 BLN LIRA  SPREAD     -20 BP    MATURITY    23.AUG.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 6M LIBOR  PAY DATE   S23.JAN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  100.375   FULL FEES   50 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	S=SHORT FIRST COUPON 1ML-20 BP TO 23.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (M) 5-50    SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT/CH</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   TAX PROVS  STD	 MGT/UND     12.5 BP</p>
<p>SELL CONC  37.5 BP -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
